,"word":"editorial","sort_order":1,"sense":"社論","alt_zh":"成年報紙編輯與高中訪客在新聞室討論公園照片與社論版面，文字不可辨識。","example":"The newspaper's editorial supported protecting the riverside park.","example_zh":"報紙社論支持保護河岸公園。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/editorial-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-electorate-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"electorate","sort_order":1,"sense":"選民","alt_zh":"虛構成年地方候選人在市民禮堂耐心回答多元成年居民問題，無政黨標語。","example":"The candidates answered questions from the electorate at the public meeting.","example_zh":"候選人在公開會議回答選民提問。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/electorate-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-elongation-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"elongation","sort_order":1,"sense":"延長；伸長","alt_zh":"高中生與老師在安全科學桌用量尺觀察掛小砝碼的彈簧伸長，無數字。","example":"The experiment measured the elongation of a spring under a small weight.","example_zh":"實驗測量彈簧掛上小砝碼後的伸長量。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/elongation-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-emigration-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"emigration","sort_order":1,"sense":"移出","alt_zh":"成年家人與高中生在桌上查看祖先提行李離開港口的老照片，神情溫和。","example":"The old photographs documented the family's emigration to another country.","example_zh":"老照片記錄那個家庭移居另一國的經過。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/emigration-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-eminence-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"eminence","sort_order":1,"sense":"卓越；聲望","alt_zh":"受敬重的成年科學家在大學演講廳示範模型，成年學生專注聆聽。","example":"The scientist's eminence attracted students from many universities.","example_zh":"那位科學家的卓越聲望吸引多所大學的學生。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/eminence-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-empowerment-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"empowerment","sort_order":1,"sense":"賦權；自主能力提升","alt_zh":"成年導師帶高中生在安全工坊自信完成自行車簡單修繕，大家互相支持。","example":"The workshop promoted empowerment by teaching practical repair skills.","example_zh":"工作坊透過教授實用修繕技能，幫助參與者培養自主能力。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/empowerment-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-emulation-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"emulation","sort_order":1,"sense":"仿效","alt_zh":"高中美術學生在成年老師指導下觀察古老畫作的筆觸並練習，無複製品牌文字。","example":"Her emulation of the master's brushwork helped her learn new techniques.","example_zh":"她仿效大師筆法，學會新技巧。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/emulation-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-encroachment-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"encroachment","sort_order":1,"sense":"侵犯","alt_zh":"高中生與環境老師從安全觀景臺查看草甸邊緣逐步擴大的建築區。","example":"The new buildings caused encroachment on the meadow.","example_zh":"新建築逐漸侵占草地。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/encroachment-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-enumeration-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"enumeration","sort_order":1,"sense":"列舉","alt_zh":"高中生把模型工具逐一排列，對照無可讀文字的清單核對。","example":"The report included an enumeration of the tools needed for the project.","example_zh":"報告列出專案所需的各項工具。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/enumeration-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-environmentalist-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"environmentalist","sort_order":1,"sense":"環保人士","alt_zh":"成年環境工作者在安全濕地步道向高中生與居民介紹鳥類、蘆葦與保育。","example":"The environmentalist encouraged residents to protect the wetlands.","example_zh":"環保人士鼓勵居民保護濕地。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/environmentalist-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-epidemiology-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"epidemiology","sort_order":1,"sense":"流行病學","alt_zh":"成年公衛研究員與成年大學生查看匿名無字人口圖表與地圖，無個人病歷或操作。","example":"The epidemiology seminar examined patterns of illness across communities.","example_zh":"流行病學研討會研究不同社區的疾病分布型態。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/epidemiology-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-epistemology-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"epistemology","sort_order":1,"sense":"認識論","alt_zh":"成年哲學教師與成年學生圍桌比較觀察證據、書籍與問題圖卡，無可讀文字。","example":"The epistemology class asked how people know whether a claim is justified.","example_zh":"認識論課探問，人們如何知道一項主張是否有根據。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/epistemology-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-eradication-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"eradication","sort_order":1,"sense":"根除","alt_zh":"成年園丁與高中志工戴手套連根移除花圃入侵雜草，分類收集，無農藥。","example":"The gardeners planned the eradication of the invasive weeds.","example_zh":"園丁規劃根除入侵雜草。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/eradication-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-establishment-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"establishment","sort_order":1,"sense":"建立","alt_zh":"成年居民與高中生在新公共圖書館開幕時進入明亮閱讀空間，無可讀文字。","example":"The establishment of the public library changed the town's cultural life.","example_zh":"