haustion-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"exhaustion","sort_order":1,"sense":"精疲力竭","alt_zh":"高中志工與成年老師完成花園工作後在陰涼長椅休息、喝水，工具安全收好。","example":"The volunteers rested after working to the point of exhaustion.","example_zh":"志工工作得精疲力竭後休息。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/exhaustion-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1}]$senior_rows$::jsonb) as r(id text,level text,word text,sort_order integer,sense text,alt_zh text,example text,example_zh text,image_url text,local_path text,style text,version integer) on conflict(id) do nothing;
